Package: bdiver
Type: Package
Title: Client for the BacDive Bacterial Diversity Metadatabase API
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person("A", "Wokaty", email = "andres.wokaty@sph.cuny.edu",
        role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an interface to version 2 of the BacDive (the
    Bacterial Diversity Metadatabase) web service at
    https://api.bacdive.dsmz.de/v2/. Strains can be searched by taxon,
    culture collection number, 16S rRNA gene accession, or genome
    assembly accession, and full strain records can be retrieved. Records
    can be flattened into tables using a user-defined field specification,
    and the complete database can be exported to a delimited file, for
    example to be used as a data source for bugphyzz. AI-predicted traits
    are excluded unless explicitly requested.
License: Artistic-2.0
